persists in any conduct which is prejudicial to safety, health, or the protection of the environment;
based on reasonable evidence, is determined to have engaged in Fraud and Corruption during the execution of the Contract; 
has been recruited from the Purchaser’s Personnel;
engages in any other behaviour which breaches the Code of Conduct, as applicable;
If appropriate, the Supplier shall then promptly appoint (or cause to be appointed) a suitable replacement with equivalent skills and experience. 
